# binary
bin/
/knumble-tutor
/knumble-acp

# Go
*.out
*.test
*.prof
coverage.html

# socket
*.sock

# Credentials. This repository is public: nothing that authenticates
# anything should ever be committable by accident.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.p12
*.key
id_rsa
id_ed25519

# Learner state.
# LLM_TUTOR_DATA can point the data dir at any path, including this checkout,
# in which case the daemon writes these files here on first run. They hold a
# real person's learning history, so they are anchored to the repo root and
# kept out of git. The seed copies under internal/app/content/ are unaffected.
/config.json
/progress.json
/learner-profile.json
/learning-events.jsonl
/scratchpad.json
/.seeded.json
/lesson-plans/
/souls/
/MENTOR.md
# CLAUDE.md is deliberately NOT ignored. The data dir seeds one, but it is
# tutor instructions rather than personal state, and a contributor may well
# want to commit an agent-instructions file at the root.

# editors
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# local agent settings
.claude/settings.local.json

# Dolt database files (added by bd init)
.dolt/
*.db
